<title>CANADA: Placer to restructure Detour Lake mine.</title>
<headline>Placer to restructure Detour Lake mine.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placer Dome Inc on Tuesday said it was restructuring its Detour Lake gold mine in Canada in an effort to return it to profitability.</p>
<p>As part of the program, the company will lay off 103 of 347 employees at the mine. It also cut the mine's 1997 production forecast to 117,000 ounces of gold from 147,000 ounces.</p>
</text>
